        <mxCell id="note_balance" value="&lt;b&gt;BALANCING &amp;amp; DECOMPOSITION RULES (RULE_DFD.MD):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Rule 1 (Forwarding):&lt;/b&gt; 1.1 validates raw input and forwards to 1.2; 1.3 checks length &amp;amp; confirmation match and forwards to 1.4.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Rule 3 (Independent Separation):&lt;/b&gt; Login (1.1, 1.2) and Change Password (1.3, 1.4) are two independent flows without direct cross-talk.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Level 1 Boundary Preservation:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;  - Inputs from Admin: [username, password] + [old, new] = &lt;i&gt;Authentication Credentials (Login / Change Password)&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;br&gt;  - Outputs to Admin: [JWT Token] + [Password Change Result] = &lt;i&gt;Authentication Result (JWT Token / Status)&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;br&gt;  - D1 Interaction: Read [Account Info &amp;amp; Password], Write [Login Timestamp &amp;amp; New Password].&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;I/O Limit:&lt;/b&gt; 1.1 &amp;amp; 1.3 have 1 in / 1 out; 1.2 &amp;amp; 1.4 have 2 in / 2 out (all ≤ 3 groups)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#F9FAFB;strokeColor=#D1D5DB;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=11;fontColor=#374151;" vertex="1" parent="1">
